## 🏗️ Widget Architecture Patterns

### Screen Organization Rules
- **Feature-based screens** in `screens/[feature]/`
- **Screen-specific widgets** in `screens/[feature]/widgets/`  
- **Animations** in `screens/[feature]/widgets/animations/`
- **Truly reusable components** in `shared/widgets/`

### Extract Complex Build Methods Pattern
```dart
@override
Widget build(BuildContext context) {
  return Scaffold(
    body: SafeArea(
      child: _buildContent(),
    ),
  );
}

Widget _buildContent() {
  return Column(
    children: [
      _buildHeader(),
      Expanded(child: _buildGamesList()),
      _buildBottomActions(),
    ],
  );
}

Widget _buildHeader() {
  return Container(
    padding: MainScreenStyles.headerPadding,
    child: _buildSearchBar(),
  );
}
```

